    [
        'slug'       => 'how-to-open-a-trump-account',
        'title'      => 'How to Open a Trump Account: Form 4547 Step by Step',
        'keyword'    => 'how to open a trump account',
        'desc'       => 'How to open a Trump account in 2026: claim the auto-enrolled account, file Form 4547 for the $1,000, who can sign up, documents needed and key dates.',
        'excerpt'    => 'A step-by-step guide to claiming or opening a Trump account, filing Form 4547 for the $1,000 pilot deposit, and deciding whether to contribute.',
        'answer'     => 'Since October 1, 2026, Treasury has automatically opened a Trump account for every eligible child under 18 with a Social Security number. A parent or guardian then claims and activates it in the official Trump Accounts app or website. To get the $1,000 federal deposit for a child born 2025 to 2028, you must also file Form 4547.',
        'takeaways'  => [
