            [ 'Does my child need to do anything to get the Dell $250?', 'Invest America says deposits went into eligible children’s accounts automatically, and families who claimed an account or filed Form 4547 before October 1, 2026 keep their eligibility with no further action. A parent should claim the account in the Trump Accounts app to see the deposit and manage it.' ],
            [ 'Can older children get the Dell $250?', 'The final allocation covered children born 2016 through 2024. Invest America says funds have been reserved for children in foster care, with details still being determined and deposits expected next year. Older children can still receive family and employer contributions and other philanthropic deposits, but not the $1,000 federal pilot deposit.' ],
